{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "What is ATmosphereConf?",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "ATmosphereConf is a community organized global conference for and by the ATProto community, the open social protocol that powers Bluesky and many other apps.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "We have many people already volunteering their time as organizers, speakers & discussion leads, and local activity leads, plus a small crew of paid conference producers.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "For the on-site workshops and main conference days, we need additional people to volunteer for a shift or two.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Who can Volunteer?",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Anyone who is locally available in Vancouver during the conference timeframe, Wednesday, March 26th through Sunday, March 29th.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "We're especially eager to invite students from local Vancouver educational institutions. Spend some time volunteering and get a no charge ticket to attend the whole conference. This conference will be a fantastic place to network with builders, creators, academics, and more, all working in the distributed open web scene. ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "What does Volunteering look like?",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Volunteers will be asked to ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "sign up for a few shifts",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ", and in return receive a no-charge ticket to the full conference.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "You'll also get an ATmosphereConf \"Volunteer\" exclusive T-Shirt to wear while on duty and to keep as a souvenir. While you're not on shift, you will have time to attend workshops, talks, and other activities.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Right now, we are planning ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "4 hour shifts",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " for tasks like registration desk, info booth, room monitor, etc.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "Sign up form at this link 👉 ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "https://tally.so/r/zxNLd1",
          "marks": {},
          "link": {
            "href": "https://tally.so/r/zxNLd1",
            "record": null
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "or fill out in the embedded form below 👇",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
